<!--

File: u-datahub.sfc

A custom element that provides the same publish/subscribe data layer as the legacy
standalone data-hub.js module, but as a SFC component.

Copyright (c) 2025 by Matthias Hertel, http://www.mathertel.de
This work is licensed under a BSD-3-Clause license. See http://www.mathertel.de/License.aspx

